; NFS client: read the test file every few seconds for about 4 minutes
; while the NAS's NFS service is restarted by hand. Every round logs the
; time and the byte sum to DH0:PrismNet/restart.log; a round that stalls
; and then completes shows the handler riding out the restart.
FailAt 21
Copy DH0:PrismNet/cfg/dhcp ENV:PrismNet ALL QUIET
C:PrismNet START
Wait 6
Mount DH0:PrismNet/nfs/PN0
Echo "start" >DH0:PrismNet/restart.log
Set n 0
Lab loop
Date >>DH0:PrismNet/restart.log
DH0:PrismNet/nfstest PN0: FILE=smb2fs.m68k-amigaos.lha >>DH0:PrismNet/restart.log
Wait 4
Set n `Eval $n + 1`
If VAL $n LT 40
  Skip loop BACK
EndIf
Date >>DH0:PrismNet/restart.log
Echo "DONE" >>DH0:PrismNet/restart.log
